<section class="page-lead page-shell" aria-labelledby="work-title">
  <p class="eyebrow">ForgeWire Labs · Our work</p>
  <h1 id="work-title">Engineering across <em>systems, software, and learning.</em></h1>
  <p class="lead-copy">ForgeWire Labs investigates how software can remain useful when work crosses models, repositories, machines, and platforms. Independent projects bring this work into practice across infrastructure, software, and technical learning.</p>
</section>

